---
name: Sea Legs
ingredients:
  - type: Peated whisky, like Laphroaig
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Mezcal
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Almond orgeat syrup
    amount: 3/4
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Lime juice
    amount: 3/4
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: '2'
    amount: Celery bitters
    unit: dashes
    garnish: false
  - type: Angostura bitters
    amount: '1'
    unit: dashes
    garnish: true
category:
  - whisky
image: ../../images/cocktails/sea-legs/image.jpg
sourceUrl: https://youtu.be/8Hll45WbmWc?si=5BNMWjaCmZYaPCKV
---
1. Add ingredients to a shaker. Add ice and shake hard for 20 seconds.
1. Strain into a chilled coupe.
